        "summary_cn": "本文报道了一种结构明确的五臂PEG化富勒烯衍生物FPEG5，具有活性氧（ROS）清除与靶向GSK-3β双重功能，通过稳定β-catenin、抑制NF-κB炎症通路，将巨噬细胞从M1重编程为M2表型。将其封装于葡萄糖/ROS响应性水凝胶中，实现局部控释，在糖尿病颅骨缺损模型中促进骨再生。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "Here, we report a structurally defined, pentakis‐PEGylated fullerene derivative, termed FPEG5, which exhibits dual functionality as a potent reactive oxygen species (ROS) scavenger and an immunomodulator. Beyond its antioxidant activity, FPEG5 directly targets glycogen synthase kinase‐3β (GSK‐3β), thereby stabilizing β‐catenin and suppressing the Nuclear Factor kappa‐B (NF‐κB) inflammatory axis. This combination effectively reshapes the local immune microenvironment, restores osteogenic differentiation in vitro, and drives robust, bridging bone regeneration in a diabetic calvarial defect model",
